In my admittedly short experience with alphas, most claims
of instability can be traced to:

1) Not knowing about the PC164 64, 128, 256 meg bug (fixed by latest
milo)

2) Not running the latest version of XFree86 (upgrade)

3) Attempting to use a 3com 100 megabit card (don't use them)

Most "clones" these days are based on the DEC-manufactured PC164LX or
PC164SX motherboards. They're pretty much all the same in terms of
stability.

